    <string name="about_title">About Quick Temp Open Server</string>
    <string name="about_body">Quick Temp Open Server is a small file hub on your phone (the same server core also runs on desktop for development): mount folders you choose, share them on your LAN over HTTP and WebDAV, and optionally publish a temporary HTTPS URL with Try Cloudflare. It is not a gallery-only temporary WebDAV host, and it is not Docker OpenList.</string>
